                                                "sense_id": "d2375a05-6d2d-3cd2-8f12-d0e617845a9c",
                                                "text": "I looked up from my desk and saw that suddenly there were big flakes twirling down into the quadrangle, settling on the carefully pruned shrubbery bordering the crosswalks, the three elms still holding many of their leaves, the still-green lawns."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
